Add screen ratio page formats

Purpose: a page in a paper format leaves bars on a projector. Offer
16:9, 16:10 and 4:3 beside the paper sizes, so a lecture document can
have the shape of the room's beamer and fill it edge to edge.

Approach: the ratios are sized from the A4 long edge, keeping a
screen page as wide as a landscape A4, so pen and handwriting stay the
size the lecturer is used to. They name their landscape shape, so
picking one switches the orientation to landscape.

Constraints: independent of the presentation window, kept below it so
it can go upstream alone. Documents store only width and height, so
files stay readable by stock rnote.

